  <TextContent>k__BackingField: 'Salutations,

    A regular visited today and, I
    noticed he was drinking a peculiar beverage that I didn''t think was possible.
    Imagine my surprise when he told me that this was a product of yours. Could you
    provide me with a vial of this Fruity Extract?

    Awaiting your delivery,'
